# IntelliJ / VS Code REST Client requests for Days 1-5.
# Put your own secret below (the same value you put in agent/.env and backend/.env).
@agent = http://localhost:8001
@backend = http://localhost:8080
@secret = change-me-to-a-long-random-string
@project = 1

### DAY 1: the agent is alive (no secret needed)
GET {{agent}}/health

### DAY 1: secret works, config summary
GET {{agent}}/v1/info
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 1: wrong secret must give 401
GET {{agent}}/v1/info
X-Agent-Secret: wrong

### DAY 2: is the agent reachable from Spring Boot?
GET {{backend}}/api/agent/status

### DAY 2: create an agent task through Spring Boot
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "Add pagination to the task history list", "maxTokens": 6000 }

### DAY 2: read it (replace 1 with the id you got back)
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1

### DAY 2: list / cancel
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/cancel

### DAY 3: is Ollama up and is the model installed?
GET {{agent}}/v1/llm/status
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 3: model must answer with valid JSON (first call loads the model: slow)
POST {{agent}}/v1/llm/ping
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 4: what does the agent depend on?
GET {{agent}}/health/deep

### DAY 4: search adapter - one scored entry per FILE
POST {{agent}}/v1/context/search?project_id={{project}}&q=how are tasks stored
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 4: read one COMPLETE file
GET {{agent}}/v1/context/file?project_id={{project}}&path=backend/pom.xml
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 5: the full pipeline, synchronously
POST {{agent}}/v1/context/discover
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "project_id": 1, "command": "Add pagination to the task history list", "max_tokens": 6000, "include_markdown": true }

### DAY 5: the same through Spring Boot, then download the pack
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/pack.md

### DAY 6: answer the agent's questions (task must be NEEDS_INPUT; q1 comes from the task's understanding)
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "answers": { "q1": "Ratings cannot be changed later" } }

### DAY 6: or skip them
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/answers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "answers": {} }

### DAY 7: how the project is built and written
GET {{agent}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/profile
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 7: ignore the cache
GET {{agent}}/v1/projects/{{project}}/profile?refresh=true
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 8: impact analysis is part of the task (see details.impact)
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1

### DAY 9: the plan as JSON + markdown
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/plan

### DAY 9: the plan as markdown
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/plan.md

### DAY 10: edit the plan (becomes version 2)
PUT {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{ "steps": [ { "title": "Update the service", "description": "...", "action": "modify", "files": ["backend/src/main/java/com/contextlayer/backend/task/TaskService.java"] },
             { "title": "Verify", "description": "", "action": "verify", "files": [], "verify": "backend:compile" } ] }

### DAY 10: approve version 2, acknowledging risky steps (e.g. ["s1"])
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 2, "acknowledged": [], "note": "looks right" }

### DAY 10: reject
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/reject
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Wrong approach: use a new table" }

### DAY 11: continue an APPROVED run (creates the private workspace; later days also implement and verify)
POST {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/implement
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 11: the workspace and what changed in it
GET {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/workspace
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 11: run ONE named command from the profile inside the workspace (first Maven run downloads dependencies)
POST {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/workspace/commands
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "command": "backend:compile" }

### DAY 11/12: everything changed so far, as a diff
GET {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/diff
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 12: apply edits by hand (only files in the approved plan are allowed)
POST {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/workspace/edits
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "manual edit", "text": "FILE: backend/src/main/java/com/contextlayer/backend/task/TaskService.java\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\nexact line from the file\n=======\nthe replacement\n>>>>>>> REPLACE" }

### DAY 12: checkpoints and totals
GET {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/changes
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}

### DAY 12: undo everything (or pass a checkpoint id from /changes)
POST {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/workspace/rollback
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "baseline" }

### DAY 13: start (or retry) the implementation through Spring Boot, then read the diff
POST {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/implement

###
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1/diff

### DAY 14: run the plan's verification commands again (manual re-check)
POST {{agent}}/v1/runs/1/workspace/verify
X-Agent-Secret: {{secret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### DAY 15: the whole story is in the task: details.implementation, details.verification, details.repair
GET {{backend}}/api/projects/{{project}}/agent/tasks/1

